      "writtenOn": "2023-07-18T16:48:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are two cases where we will run into the problem:\n1. When \"Move Content\" is triggered, i.e., migration of media to from internal storage and Adopted storage (and vice versa) from Settings.\n2. When move app is triggered (for supported apps) which moves the app-data files from internal storage to adopted storage (and vice versa) from Settings.\n\nIn these two cases when the system tries to copy over the files, the adopted storage stays locked so those operations fail. This is specific to a situation where multi-user has been enabled in a device (as for the current running user the storage stays unlocked as long the user has authenticated)",
      "parentUuid": "ea3c5cf1_c758204e",
      "revId": "4196bd8bc4b8169e952a2f958ed78c540403d948",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
