      "writtenOn": "2023-07-18T17:03:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not too familiar with \"move content\" and \"move app\", sorry.  Are you saying they attempt to move CE data files that belong to non-current users?  That doesn\u0027t seem correct, as there is no guarantee that CE data files that belong to non-current users are unlocked, regardless of whether they\u0027re on internal or adoptable storage.  Have you looked into the root cause of why/how these operations are attempting to move CE data files of non-current users?",
      "parentUuid": "760bf2e9_e018c646",
      "revId": "4196bd8bc4b8169e952a2f958ed78c540403d948",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
